  "content_description": "Ethics",
  "content_text_body": "Available training and materials help employees learn how to recognize unethical actions and behaviors. Include in these resources an overview of your company's ethical policies and practices, along with examples of ethics violations. Further, share how your organization reports, investigates, and seeks to resolve unethical behavior.\n\nIt is important to remind individuals of the potential consequences of ethics violations that go unreported, as well as the consequences of retaliation against an employee who reported a violation of workplace ethics.",
